:"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:b65aca98ae002cdd76ca20558b7b671752b5da725273cb6a09a7c77a7641f3ef","file":"preprints/Global-Spherical-Shells-on-Minimal-Surfaces-of-Class-VII-September-24-2026/build/paper.tex","line":102,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"a0a72d09f7fea4d4ec74ba3c61b71db19656cd280f2486016dfc70eb6e09d6c2","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Global-Spherical-Shells-on-Minimal-Surfaces-of-Class-VII-September-24-2026/build/paper.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:b65aca98ae002cdd76ca20558b7b671752b5da725273cb6a09a7c77a7641f3ef","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Global-Spherical-Shells-on-Minimal-Surfaces-of-Class-VII-September-24-2026/build/paper.tex#L102"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nLet $X$ be a connected compact complex surface with\n\\[\n b_1(X)=1,\\qquad b_2(X)>0,\\qquad \\kappa(X)=-\\infty.\n\\]\nAssume that $X$ is minimal: it contains no smooth rational curve of\nself-intersection $-1$. Then there are an open neighborhood $U$ of\n\\[\n S^3=\\{z\\in\\CC^2:|z|=1\\}\n \\quad\\text{in }\\CC^2\\setminus\\{0\\},\n\\]\nan open subset $\\Sigma\\subset X$, and a biholomorphism\n$\\phi:U\\longrightarrow\\Sigma$ such that $X\\setminus\\Sigma$ is connected."}
